<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		20/10 D	June	    23/15 D</p>
<p> July		18/10 D	July	    18/15 D</p>
<p> August	    25/40 P	August	  10/30 P</p>
<p> Sept	     90/130 P	Sept	   90/120 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		27/25 D	June	    30/29 D</p>
<p> July		26/25 D	July	    31/29 D</p>
<p> August		9/7 D	August	  11/10 D</p>
<p> Sept		  4/6 P	Sept		5/7 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		35/55 P	 June	   30/60 P</p>
<p> July		35/55 P	 July	   40/50 P</p>
<p> August	    10/50 P	 August     even/40 P</p>
<p> Sept		10/50 P	 Sept	 even/30 P</p>
